Your job is live
================

Good news: we approved your job and it's now on the Dev Registry job board.

  <%= @job.title %>
  <%= @job_url %>

It stays up until <%= @job.expires_at.to_date.to_fs(:long) %>, and you can renew it from your company dashboard (<%= @dashboard_url %>). From now on, jobs you publish for <%= @company.name %> go live straight away.
